The following commit is causing some severe sound issues on one of my
machines (i.e. sound is almost dead except some "plops", sometimes,
when playing with volume)

commit 58541cc27531727f7120683a7cb123ee3ada4bd4
Author: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>
